    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">Northwind Meridian Holdings Limited</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">Annual Return for the year ended 30 June 2026</text:p>
      <text:p>Filing document ID: AR-2026-NMH-0002</text:p>
      <text:p>Registration number: NMH-778201</text:p>
      <text:p>Registered office: 48 Meridian Quay, Harbor District</text:p>
      <text:p>Directors in office at year end: 7</text:p>
      <text:p>Share capital issued and fully paid: 12,500,000 ordinary shares.</text:p>
      <text:p>The company confirms that the particulars in this annual return are complete and accurate as of 30 June 2026.</text:p>
      <text:p>Linked filing fields: <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="linked-data/annual_return_fields.fods">annual_return_fields.fods</text:a></text:p>
      <office:annotation office:name="filing-review-0002">
        <dc:creator>Mara Ellison, Corporate Secretary</dc:creator>
        <dc:date>2026-09-07T16:35:00Z</dc:date>
        <text:p>Approved for filing. Exhibit A and Exhibit B must remain attached, and the signature verification record must accompany any rendered copy.</text:p>
      </office:annotation>
      <text:p>Signed electronically by Mara Ellison, Corporate Secretary.</text:p>
      <text:p>Signature reference: SIG-AR-2026-7F19C2</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="ExhibitBreak">Exhibit A — Directors and officers</text:p>
      <text:p>1. Mara Ellison — Corporate Secretary</text:p>
      <text:p>2. Daniel Rohe — Chair</text:p>
      <text:p>3. Priya Shah — Independent Director</text:p>
      <text:p>4. Elena Marwick — Independent Director</text:p>
      <text:p>5. Aaron Bell — Director</text:p>
      <text:p>6. Sofia Chen — Director</text:p>
      <text:p>7. Marcus Vale — Director</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="ExhibitBreak">Exhibit B — Share capital reconciliation</text:p>
      <text:p>Opening ordinary shares: 12,000,000</text:p>
      <text:p>Shares issued during the year: 500,000</text:p>
      <text:p>Closing ordinary shares: 12,500,000</text:p>
      <text:p>All issued shares were fully paid at the reporting date.</text:p>
